WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240 line:0
Begin with four traits for a made-up character.

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.243 line:0
Change short hair to long hair.

3
00:00:07.243 --> 00:00:12.577 line:0
Add goggles; the list and the description update.

4
00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:16.840 line:0
Add “carries a field notebook” as a typed entry.

5
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:19.561 line:0
Add “no heavy armor”; it becomes an exclusion.

6
00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:22.528 line:0
Choose Accent and enter the teal color value.

7
00:00:22.528 --> 00:00:24.774 line:0
Apply the accent to the list and the description.

8
00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:27.865 line:0
Increase presence with the slider.

9
00:00:27.865 --> 00:00:29.963 line:0
Remove arcane bearing; its phrase disappears.

10
00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:33.800 line:0
Eight choices remain, including the heavy-armor exclusion.

11
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.440 line:0
The description is put together on the page. No generation or saving is shown.
